config SGX545_CE
	tristate "PowerVR SGX545 (Intel CE5300 / Cedarview) kernel services"
	depends on X86 && DRM
	help
	  Kernel services (pvrsrvkm) for the Imagination PowerVR SGX545 GPU as
	  fitted to the Intel Atom CE5300/CE5310 — and to Cedarview (GMA
	  3600/3650), which carries the same core. Ported from Intel's GPL
	  DDK 1.7.862890.

	  This is the kernel half only. 3D additionally needs the matching
	  DDK 1.7 userspace (EGL/GLES blobs + pvrsrvctl, which uploads the
	  microkernel); the driver only has to accept that upload.

	  Say M to build pvrsrvkm as a loadable module (recommended — the DDK is
	  large and this keeps it out of the kernel image), or Y to build it in
	  (which also works with CONFIG_MODULES=n).

	  If unsure, say N.
